@startuml
' Figure 37.7  The model update that moved the outcome
' Reading order: top to bottom, Wednesday, July 8, 2026, CDT. The
' vendor moves the alias; a combined retime and renumber is coded as a
' retime; the agent reissues on the old number; the reconciler cannot
' verify it; the desk sees the rework at 2:41 p.m.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Vendor" as V <<model>>
participant "Classifier" as C <<model>>
participant "Agent" as A <<model>>
participant "Reconciler" as R <<fail>>
V -> C : 1:15 alias
note over V, C : No deploy
C -> A : Retime only
A -> R : Old number
R -[$FAIL]> R : Not verified
note over R : 40 by 2:41 p.m.
@enduml
